# With completed hidden, Complete from the command menu while editing a Today entry keeps editing it, so typed text does not run commands on the next entry.
# BUG: the entry leaves Today, editing ends, and the typed dd deletes the next entry
file <<END
- Aa @due({today})
- Bb @due({today})
END
keys gc gt <Enter> /
type comp
keys <Enter>
type dd
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Aadd @due({today}) @done({today})
- Bb @due({today})
END
